msgctxt "80"
msgid "...Hurry up and kill me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "I told you already. That's not how I do things."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Heheh... Oh really..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"Then what if I told you I'll murder every last loved one you\r\n"
"hold dear on the condition you leave me alive?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "I won't let that happen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"Heheh, then you've got to end it right here. Right now.\r\n"
"Just get it over with."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "That won't happen!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "And why not!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"Look, I don't live by your principles. If you want to live\r\n"
"by some ancient, barbaric code of honor, then fine. You'll\r\n"
"just have to come at me again when you're stronger."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"And there's no need to get innocent people involved.\r\n"
"I'll take you head on whenever you want⑬and win.\r\n"
"That's all I have to say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "All right, then. I'm leaving."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Amon! Show yourself!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"Welcome, Kazuma Kiryu. How was the trip here? Enjoy the\r\n"
"scenery? Heheheh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "Enough with the chatter. I have some questions for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "Oh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid ""
"You don't seem to kill for business or even for pleasure.\r\n"
"So what do you hope to gain by killing me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid ""
"And what are your plans if you do beat me? I want answers,\r\n"
"Amon! Why are you so hell-bent on fighting to the death!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid ""
"That's what you wanted to ask...? Heheh... How naive.\r\n"
"What does a dead man care about the future?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "But I'll answer you regardless."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid ""
"The essential nature of living creatures is to tear each\r\n"
"other down. One cannot live without taking another's life.\r\n"
"In fact, it's the core of our very being."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid ""
"We of the Amon Clan see our mission as the pursuit and\r\n"
"mastery of this vocation. It's also our personal mandate, as\r\n"
"we seek to become the most powerful life forms on Earth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid ""
"From birth, we're placed among carnage and are forced to\r\n"
"kill or be killed. Our skills are honed not to stroke a\r\n"
"petty ego, but to survive another day on the battlefield."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid ""
"Defeat, for us, means the end of our lives. Thus, if we wish\r\n"
"to take another breath, another's must be snuffed out.\r\n"
"The only good is life; the only evil, death."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid ""
"However, there is one thing our clan considers a worse evil\r\n"
"than death... and that's for the defeated to live on in his\r\n"
"weakness. Or her. His or her weakness. \"Their\" works, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid ""
"Kazuma Kiryu, you defeated me, yet you left me clinging to\r\n"
"a miserable existence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid ""
"Your act of allowing me to live is folly and a mortal sin in\r\n"
"the eyes of my clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid ""
"In my eyes, you⑬Kazuma Kiryu⑬are the strongest life form.\r\n"
"As long as you remain alive, I cannot truly be complete.\r\n"
"And that is the answer to your questions."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid ""
"All right. I think I understand. But I say your line of\r\n"
"thinking is way off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "...What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid ""
"You claim killing is your clan's mandate, but if that's\r\n"
"your only motivation⑬someone else's ideology⑬then you're\r\n"
"no better than an animal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid ""
"You may insist on taking life, but I insist on protecting\r\n"
"it... On living without running away. That's the \"mandate\"\r\n"
"that was taught to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid ""
"Heheheh. I was wondering how you'd respond... Everything\r\n"
"you've said is completely incomprehensible. But don't take\r\n"
"it personally."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid ""
"I think we've done enough philosophizing. Words will not\r\n"
"suffice here... Only the clashing of muscle and bone can\r\n"
"determine our fate here! You won't escape me alive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid "Very well. I require no response from you. Prepare yourself!"
msgstr ""

